%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: SuperWeirdRouteYuriKonsequenc
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey Sayori, did you need something?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you remember what happened with the spider at the Barrow?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791092
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...!!!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791093
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... yeah?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791094
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, uh, I think something similar happened to Yuri. Or maybe even the
      same thing.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791095
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh. That's bad.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: A strange voice spoke to her, but didn't do it through sound, <i>and</i>
      she was forced to act in a way she wouldn't?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>And</i> she had the same <SineText=4>weird</SineText> look in her
      eye.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791096
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: That's... really not good.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I don't know where to start with that...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It's bad enough to happen to me, but now it's more than once, and more
      people than once?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay, so it happened to me when we had to fight the spider, and I just
      couldn't do that...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791097
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What sort of situation did you find yourselves in when it happened?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, it first happened when we got trapped after I picked up a weird
      looking amulet.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791098
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And what did it make her do?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: It made her put on the necklace and blast fire at the wall we got it
      from.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... the weird voice made her solve the puzzle?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, since when could Yuri blast fire?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791099
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't know, even Yuri said she couldn't do that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791100
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And it happened a second time?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, when we were fighting the fancy draugr.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791101
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I could see it while I was trying to patch up this big gash-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Sayori drags her finger along her stomach, presumably where the wound
      would be.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri was looking scared, because she had to fight the draugr while Mr.
      Tolfdir drained its power, and-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That was when that <SineText=4>weird</SineText> look in her eyes came
      back.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791102
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hm.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: So all three times came in moments of... need, I guess?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Because I couldn't fight the spider, presumably they couldn't solve the
      puzzle, and Yuri couldn't fight the draugr...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: So does that make this... possessor (or possessors) benevolent?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: As benevolent as someone that takes control over someone else's body
      could be...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hrmn...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well... for now it seems that the... possessions <i>seem</i> to only
      benefit us.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: For now...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Should we do something?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791103
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori... Do <i>what</i> exactly?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791105
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't know...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't know either.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I- I'm scared {mc}. I'm scared it could happen to me too, or that strange
      voice will completely take over you or Yuri, and-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791106
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'm scared too.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's gonna be fine, Sayori.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh? How could you say that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Simple, the more times it happens, the more we can learn about <i>why</i>
      it happens.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And if we know the "why," we could probably do something about it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I hope you're right...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791107
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I hope so too...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I walk up to her and give Sayori a hug.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791108
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's going to be alright.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: At this point, I'm trying to convince myself of that just as much as
      I'm trying to convince her...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's going to be alright...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791109
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}...?'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika left a while ago.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791110
    - rid: 4351268260154179642
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... oh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I let go of Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791111
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, I'll be seeing you around. Good luck, Sayori!
    ScreenActions: []
